    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/a9393817dc9ec028270376cbe5c7358d.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=256 /></span><br>Dunchess is a turn-based dungeon crawler where you play chess pieces. Different dungeons present never-boring challenges to overcome while you protect the king and try to remove the enemy pieces.<br><br><strong>\u265f\ufe0f Play the chess pieces in different dungeon levels!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We keep the mechanics that you already know how to use and if you don't know how, don't worry! The game is pretty intuitive, showing you what are your possible movements when you hover pieces \ud83d\ude09<br><br><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Be aware of the new unique tiles that change the dungeon as you play!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We're introducing new tiles to the dungeons, in the case above \ud83d\udc46 it's an activator to elevate bridges. And this is just the start! More will be submitted as we update the game.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Plan your strategy and do not let your king be captured!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Forget about the check, this is a no-regret move type of game. Make a wrong move and pay the price for it \ud83d\ude08<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Make your own maps!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Did we mention that you can create your own maps?! Also, publish them and play others!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/a9393817dc9ec028270376cbe5c7358d.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=256 /></span><br>Dunchess is a turn-based dungeon crawler where you play chess pieces. Different dungeons present never-boring challenges to overcome while you protect the king and try to remove the enemy pieces.<br><br><strong>\u265f\ufe0f Play the chess pieces in different dungeon levels!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/883a2de783a0a8f44ca68def44d928a4.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We keep the mechanics that you already know how to use and if you don't know how, don't worry! The game is pretty intuitive, showing you what are your possible movements when you hover pieces \ud83d\ude09<br><br><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Be aware of the new unique tiles that change the dungeon as you play!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/b24012715c4753b210f3651f56d185eb.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We're introducing new tiles to the dungeons, in the case above \ud83d\udc46 it's an activator to elevate bridges. And this is just the start! More will be submitted as we update the game.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Plan your strategy and do not let your king be captured!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4bc0c75e1d6c1ecfae0732c762b1b4c8.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Forget about the check, this is a no-regret move type of game. Make a wrong move and pay the price for it \ud83d\ude08<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Make your own maps!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.poster.avif?t=1745433800\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.webm?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614910/extras/4f45580dedb70f0b1427fbcc751dbff5.mp4?t=1745433800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Did we mention that you can create your own maps?! Also, publish them and play others!",
    "short_description": "Master the art of turn-based chess mechanics in ever-changing dungeons! Navigate bridges, teleporters, and more as you strategize your way to victory in this unique chess roguelike adventure. Plus, create your own maps and explore others' creations!",
